---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';

const title = 'Adaptive Lessons';
const description = 'Individualized music instruction for students with disabilities, medical conditions, or learning differences.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="content-page">
			<h1>Adaptive Lessons</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				At Opus Conservatory, we believe every child deserves the chance to experience the joy of
				music. Our Adaptive Lessons are designed for students of all ages with learning differences,
				disabilities, or medical conditions who want to sing or play an instrument. These lessons are
				taught by our board-certified music therapists, ensuring individualized instruction that
				meets each student's unique strengths and challenges.
			</p>

			<h2>What changes</h2>
			<p>
				We adapt instruments, the learning environment, teaching methods, and sensory elements so
				every student can thrive. Adaptations may include adjusting the pace of instruction,
				modifying expectations, incorporating breaks, and using strategies tailored to each learner's
				needs. Beyond musical growth, Adaptive Lessons also nurture essential skills such as
				attention, memory, perception, cognitive flexibility, and emotional expression.
			</p>

			<h2>Who leads these lessons</h2>
			<p>
				Because our music therapists are trained to work with a wide range of disabilities and health
				needs, they know how to personalize each lesson to match every student's learning style and
				abilities — creating a truly positive and rewarding musical experience.
			</p>

			<h2>Areas of study</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Piano</li>
				<li>Guitar</li>
				<li>Voice</li>
				<li>Ukulele</li>
				<li>Hand percussion</li>
				<li>Music theory</li>
				<li>Composition</li>
				<li>Improvisation</li>
			</ul>

			<p>
				Both studios are single-floor and wheelchair accessible, with wide doorways and accessible
				restrooms.
			</p>

			<div class="button-row">
				<a class="button" href="/free-trial">Book a Free Trial</a>
				<a class="button button-outline" href="/programs/music-therapy">See Music Therapy</a>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
